.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3071\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9D%8E%E5%90%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"坎吉拉\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9D%8E%E5%90%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"坎吉拉\"><img alt=\"坎吉拉\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9D%8E%E5%90%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"坎吉拉\">坎吉拉</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.0</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>十六位狂欢</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：307103</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">出拳，出脚！翻滚，回击！胜利，或是再来一次！酣畅淋漓的格斗游戏，提供了另一种与生活所不同的自由。<br />《超级战士：午夜长鸣》正是这类游戏的佼佼者，许多人即使不在街机前，也还在模仿着游戏中的一招一式，游戏角色的装扮也成了一种新潮流，如果不了解上一点，简直无法加入街头的谈话。<br />但潮流中的参与者，却并非都对游戏本身如数家珍。“因为我很适合”也算一个理由，灵活的身手，俏皮的神情，仅靠扮演几个动作便可收取报酬，与扮演者适合角色相对，这个角色也相当适合这位扮演者。<br />“猫人！猫人妮露亚——快过来！”随着一声招呼，女孩灵巧地攀上房檐，追着两只彩色的蝴蝶，消失在了街道另一边。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7b/Belonging-307104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">黑色毛绒手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Black Paw Gloves</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.42<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>有着可爱造型的硕大毛绒手套。与外表看上去不同，锐利的爪子并非武器，仅是一种装扮上的需要。一位能歌善舞的猫女郎，很适合成为音乐剧舞台上的璀璨明星。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/43/Belonging-307105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“超级战士”腰带<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Super Warrior\" Belt</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.66<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>人气作品《超级战士》联名款皮质腰带，在市面上一度千金难求。<br />“嘿嘿～这可是我从跳蚤市场淘来的宝贝，羡慕吧～！”受访者似乎并不了解它原本的价值，但必须承认她运气不错。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a1/Belonging-307106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">午夜伙伴<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Midnight Companion</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>拥有鲜艳色彩的稀有蝴蝶，在夜晚会散发出耀眼夺目的光芒。<br />对猫科动物来说，它显然不是合适的伙伴。好在受访者早已深谙一套与小动物的相处之道。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 午夜来客1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A21.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 午夜来客2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8D%88%E5%A4%9C%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%A22.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">午夜来客 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Night Visitor</small></span></span>"}}